#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:441
msgid "PITFALL — sync-ui.sh Commits Massive Diffs to gh-pages"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:442
msgid ""
"The sync script runs `git add -A && git commit` when dirty files exist, "
"which can commit 14,000+ files (including docusaurus sites, bpvsbuckler "
"archives, library builds) to the `gh-pages` branch. Review the branch "
"state after sync to ensure the push succeeded and clean up if needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:444
msgid "Pitfalls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:445
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Avatar iframe mic permissions:** Must include `allow=\"microphone\"` "
"and `sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin ...\"`. If mic fails, the "
"parent page can proxy via `postMessage({ type: 'request-mic' })`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:446
msgid ""
"**Avatar in split view:** Must be compact — use `min(90px, 28vw)` for "
"sizing, percentage-based positioning, and no scrollbar. The top half is "
"only 50% viewport height."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:447
msgid ""
"**nginx `alias` vs `root`:** Use `alias` for `/avatar/`, `root` for `/`. "
"Mixing them up causes 404s."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:448
msgid ""
"**Permission on `/var/www/datro-ui/`:** Files owned by `ubuntu:ubuntu`, "
"nginx runs as `www-data` (needs read access)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/datro-webgui_SKILL.md:449
msgid ""
"**Permission on `/var/www/avatar-system/`:** Often created by root; must "
"`sudo chown -R ubuntu:ubuntu` before writing."
msgstr ""

